<title>USA: Schroder Wertheim names Haugh as chairwoman.</title>
<headline>Schroder Wertheim names Haugh as chairwoman.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Schroder Wertheim Investment Services Inc said Wednesday it had named Sharon Haugh as chairwoman of the company, replacing David Salisbury.</p>
<p>The company said Salisbury will remain on its board.</p>
<p>It also said it had changed its name to Schroder Capital Management Inc from Schroder Wertheim Investment Services Inc on March 1.</p>
</text>
